WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.250
Product strategy — Map the hypothesis to a measurable outcome

2
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:02.500
Discovery research — Synthesize the evidence

3
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.750
Programme planning — Connect outcomes to milestones

4
00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:05.000
Production planning — Plan dependencies before production

5
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.250
Jira + delivery planning — Convert ideas into testable stories

6
00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:07.500
Risk register — Make operational risks actionable

7
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:08.750
Excel + planning models — Build a capacity and budget model

8
00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:10.000
Notion + production board — Route creative reviews

9
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.250
Project management — Manage changes without losing scope

10
00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:12.500
Programme health — Detect delivery risk early

11
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:13.750
Release readiness — Make the launch decision explicit

12
00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:15.000
Operational handover — Transfer a maintainable workflow
